<p>Hopefully a lot of people who haven't heard of them see this, and follow through by looking up the Anishnaabeg on their own terms!</p>
<p>That first line is my favourite thing I've written on the site. It just HAS to be a &quot;What?&quot; moment for most readers.</p>
<p>From the start I wanted the point to not be &quot;scary indigenous legend-monsters kill people&quot; but instead &quot;stupid people don't realize they can't slot themselves into someone else's myth structure.&quot; I'm glad it worked out that way.</p>
<p>Thank you for the feedback and kind words! I'll take a look at my panther pacing :P</p>

